Qwen2.5 0.5B Instruct (Q4_K_M GGUF): the model the web copy serves beside the page
==================================================================================

This directory records the one model the web copy of Crimson Noir: Agent City serves beside its page, so a visitor
with no model of their own can talk to Sloane. The model's weights are NOT in this repository and NOT in the page
file (dist/index.html), the Windows app or any release build: the web workflow (.github/workflows/web.yml, through
tools/web/siteModel.mjs) fetches the file below from Hugging Face at the pinned revision whenever its cache (keyed by
the pin) does not hold it, and on every publish of the web copy refuses it unless its size and SHA-256 are exactly
these, and puts it in the published folder as
models/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf, with this NOTICE and LICENSE beside it. The page fetches it from its own
site only when the visitor taps for it, checks the same size and SHA-256 (src/09_Cognition/siteModel.ts SITE_MODEL),
and keeps it in the visitor's browser.

  Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf   397808192 bytes, sha256 6eb923e7d26e9cea28811e1a8e852009b21242fb157b26149d3b188f3a8c8653
  (SHA256SUMS beside this file has the same line)

